1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 2=

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:10,600
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees.

3
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:12,680
I have recently fallen slightly ill.

4
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,920
While I recuperate,

5
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,000
I fear I cannot
attend to all affairs of state.

6
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:19,360
I hereby appoint Empress Jingshu

7
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,200
to oversee
the affairs of the inner palace

8
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:23,600
and govern the court in my stead.

9
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,520
Obey this decree.

10
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:35,480
Present your memorials,

11
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:37,520
or the court shall adjourn.

12
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,400
Your Highness, I have a matter to report.

13
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:42,120
Proceed.

14
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,400
The day before yesterday,

15
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,200
Qian Su, Vice Minister of Revenue,

16
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:49,440
was assassinated on his way home.

17
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,740
Such a loyal official of the court

18
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:52,200
(Cen)

19
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,720
was brutally slain by Lu Cen.

20
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:57,320
This is an affront to imperial authority

21
00:01:57,330 --> 00:01:58,990
and threatens
the very foundation of the realm.

22
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,760
I urge that
a Crown Prince be appointed soon.

23
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:04,440
Whom does the Grand Tutor propose?

24
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,880
I believe...

25
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:09,560
Your Highness, I have a matter to report.

26
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,560
Please speak, Prince Luan.

27
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,880
At present,

28
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:14,670
our enemies to the north
grow stronger by the day,

29
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,680
while the tribes to the south

30
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,240
also harbor rebellious intentions.

31
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,480
The Ministry of Revenue
murder remains unsolved,

32
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,720
and the culprit remains at large.

33
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:24,000
Grand Tutor,

34
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,120
as a veteran official of the court,

35
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,720
you should be helping shoulder
the burdens of the realm.

36
00:02:30,010 --> 00:02:31,600
You should not use this matter

37
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,800
to provoke
a dispute over the succession.

38
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:37,060
(Zhaoming Office)

39
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:42,660
(Wanted Notice)

40
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,920
(Wanted Notice)
Ten thousand taels.

41
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,120
Who is this?

42
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,200
Why is he worth so much?

43
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,320
(Zhaoming Office)
Thank you so much.

44
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,040
If it weren't for you,

45
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:54,360
the finest legal advocate
in Bojue Kingdom,

46
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,640
speaking on my behalf,

47
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,640
I would never have escaped this ordeal.

48
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,240
I understand.

49
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,160
Bring it over.

50
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:06,220
(Zhaoming Office)

51
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:07,960
Shopkeeper.

52
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:13,640
Is being a legal advocate
really this lucrative?

53
00:03:15,180 --> 00:03:17,460
(Prince Luan's Residence)

54
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,960
Prince Luan's Residence.

55
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,240
If you ever need anything,

56
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,400
take this jade pendant

57
00:03:23,410 --> 00:03:24,920
and come find me
at Prince Luan's Residence.

58
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,000
We'll surely meet again.

59
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:30,020
(Prince Luan's Residence)

60
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,000
Xiaobai.

61
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,520
What brings you here today?

62
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:36,560
I came to see you today

63
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,680
about something very important.

64
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:41,400
I want us to start a company together.

65
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,560
What's a company?

66
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,080
A company

67
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,320
is a type of organization.

68
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,480
An organization?

69
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,880
I used to be a lawyer,

70
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,200
but I've just realized

71
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,040
that legal advocates here

72
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,560
can make a lot of money too.

73
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,800
Still, every beginning is difficult,

74
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,360
and Rome wasn't built by one person,

75
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,080
right?

76
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,760
So,

77
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,760
I was wondering
if you could be my angel investor.

78
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:01,680
You invest the money,

79
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,560
and I'll contribute my expertise.

80
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,280
Together, we'll make a fortune

81
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,280
and become rich.

82
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,600
Basically, whatever profits we make,

83
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,680
we split them fifty-fifty.

84
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,480
Half and half.

85
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,160
Did you understand any of that?

86
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,840
But I'm willing to help you.

87
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,280
So whatever you need,

88
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,600
just tell me.

89
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,080
Funding is essential,

90
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,960
and I want plenty of exposure too.

91
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,760
Get it all.

92
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,760
All of it.

93
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:30,720
Rousang,

94
00:04:31,010 --> 00:04:32,800
do you know anyone
important and influential?

95
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:36,120
What do you mean
by important and influential?

96
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,400
Someone sophisticated, prestigious,

97
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,960
and wealthy.

98
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:47,760
(Everything's going my way.)

99
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,000
(My days of making a fortune)

100
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,280
(are finally here.)

101
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:52,360
Xiaobai,

102
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,320
take a look.

103
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,160
Do I

104
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,520
need more rouge?

105
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,920
You're gorgeous, girl.

106
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,520
You've asked me three times already.

107
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,120
When exactly is this important

108
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,080
friend of yours coming?

109
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:02,920
Don't worry.

110
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
He'll be here any minute.

111
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:05,800
Rousang.

112
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:14,520
You really mean any minute, right?

113
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,720
Songpiao.

114
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,120
Songpiao.

115
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,720
This is Jiang Xiaobai.

116
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,240
And this is Songpiao,

117
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,720
the Second Prince.

118
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,480
Well?

119
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,680
Important enough for you?

120
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,320
More than enough.

121
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:31,920
Miss Jiang Xiaobai.

122
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,000
Your Highness,

123
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,920
we're truly grateful
that you're endorsing

124
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,200
our Guaranteed Win Legal House.

125
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,040
Now that everyone's here,

126
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,560
let's begin.

127
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:42,900
(Guaranteed Win)

128
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:46,540
(Win)

129
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:47,580
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

130
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,500
Let's cut the ribbon.

131
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:55,280
May our business prosper!

132
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,640
Everyone, remember our slogan:

133
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,920
Guaranteed Win Legal House.

134
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,340
(Guaranteed Win)

135
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:02,120
Get a winning start from day one.

136
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,760
Your Highness, I found the person

137
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,620
you asked me to find.

138
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:20,920
Understood.

139
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,360
I'll take my leave.

140
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:29,680
Here.

141
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:30,880
This is for you.

142
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,560
A conch shell?

143
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,200
It came from Langjing Kingdom.

144
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,720
Legend says this conch

145
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,720
can record someone's innermost thoughts,

146
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,280
and another person

147
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:43,920
can hear them simply
by holding it to their ear.

148
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:57,080
(So those two are a couple.)

149
00:06:57,560 --> 00:07:00,000
(Then I'm about
to rise through the ranks)

150
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,760
(and turn my fate around.)

151
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:05,380
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

152
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,120
This doesn't make sense.

153
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,720
We have a prince endorsing us.

154
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,680
Why isn't anyone coming in?

155
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,160
Hey, handsome.

156
00:07:13,170 --> 00:07:14,080
Need a legal advocate?

157
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:15,880
What lawsuit? Are you crazy?

158
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,000
Fine, forget it.

159
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:17,880
No need to insult me.

160
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,960
Ministry Servant's Complaint
Against Master Case.

161
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,600
Fake Live-in Son-in-law Feud Case.

162
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,600
Xiaobai,

163
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:37,400
why are all the case files
and petitions missing?

164
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,640
Were they stolen?

165
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,800
Don't be silly.

166
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,880
These were empty to begin with.

167
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,040
They're just here so clients

168
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:47,180
will be impressed by our credentials
and experience at first glance.

169
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,760
It's a business tactic.

170
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:54,640
Excuse me.

171
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,900
Which one of you
is the renowned Advocate Jiang?

172
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,480
That would be me.

173
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,960
Quick, come on!

174
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,160
Advocate Jiang,

175
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:08,200
we came all this way just to see you.

176
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,320
What do you need me for?

177
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:10,800
Here's what happened.

178
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:13,160
They were originally building
the Yushan Imperial Retreat,

179
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,160
and several shops

180
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:16,360
in the Eastern Market
were already demolished.

181
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:18,640
Now we've been told
they're widening the Imperial Road,

182
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,320
and they're going to demolish

183
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,200
all of our shops.

184
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:22,990
Then the relocation compensation
must be substantial, right?

185
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,080
There isn't any.

186
00:08:24,090 --> 00:08:25,560
Surely you're getting
replacement properties?

187
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,120
We've heard nothing about that.

188
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,360
Then they must at least
relocate you somewhere else, right?

189
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,960
No.

190
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,320
Then you...

191
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,320
We'll have nowhere to go.

192
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,240
You really need
to know your legal rights.

193
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,240
So now you're our only hope.

194
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,360
Advocate Jiang.

195
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,480
(Legal Fees)
Don't worry.

196
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:42,880
Take a look at our rates.

197
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:47,020
(Legal Fees)

198
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,440
That's a little expensive.

199
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,720
That's far too expensive.

200
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:51,960
Well,

201
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,720
the merchants among us

202
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:56,400
pooled together

203
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:57,960
everything we could,

204
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,720
and this is all we have.

205
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,880
You people aren't serious
about this lawsuit at all.

206
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:09,040
Just a few copper coins?

207
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:09,990
Do you take me for a beggar?

208
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,360
No.

209
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,560
Advocate Jiang,

210
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,550
that's not what we meant.

211
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,720
I won't accept that price.

212
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,080
But...

213
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:14,840
I won't accept it.

214
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,280
Please help us.

215
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,240
We're begging you.

216
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:19,720
Advocate Jiang.

217
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,160
We are

218
00:09:22,580 --> 00:09:23,640
sorry to have bothered you.

219
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,560
We truly apologize.

220
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:34,880
Let's go.

221
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:39,280
Let's go.

222
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,120
Come on, let's go.

223
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:40,760
Let's go.

224
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,360
Xiaobai,

225
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,640
I just remembered

226
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,080
I have something
to take care of at home.

227
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,080
I have to go back.

228
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:04,380
I'm running a business
just like everyone else.

229
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,800
Why should I be expected to do charity?

230
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,200
I want to rise to great success too.

231
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,440
Advocate Jiang.

232
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,080
Advocate...

233
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:15,760
Advocate Jiang.

234
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,720
We all

235
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,880
talked it over again carefully,

236
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:21,960
and we think

237
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,120
if we want to resolve this,

238
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,600
we still need your help.

239
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,040
The price is firm.

240
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:29,920
We

241
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,040
merchants from earlier

242
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,440
managed to pool a little more together.

243
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,000
So,

244
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,360
Advocate Jiang,

245
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:38,440
please help us.

246
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,120
Don't worry.

247
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,840
This case

248
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:44,760
is a guaranteed win.

249
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:48,220
(Zhaoming Office)

250
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:51,520
What grievance
brings you here this late at night?

251
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,280
Who are all of you?

252
00:10:55,300 --> 00:10:57,700
- We're merchants from the Eastern Market.
- We're merchants from the Eastern Market.

253
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,960
Then who's the plaintiff
and who's the defendant?

254
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,360
- We're all plaintiffs.
- We're all plaintiffs.

255
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:03,200
Well...

256
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,240
Official Huang.

257
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,720
Advocate Jiang?

258
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,920
Why is it you again?

259
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,160
Don't tell me
you're the defendant this time.

260
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:16,780
The person I'm here to sue today

261
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,120
is you, Official Huang.

262
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:26,750
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

263
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:30,100
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

264
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,500
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

265
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:35,420
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

266
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:40,290
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

267
00:11:40,660 --> 00:11:43,970
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

268
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:46,140
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

269
00:11:46,310 --> 00:11:49,640
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

270
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:55,250
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

271
00:11:55,770 --> 00:11:58,860
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

272
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,920
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

273
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:05,950
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

274
00:12:06,190 --> 00:12:09,240
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

275
00:12:09,610 --> 00:12:12,290
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

276
00:12:12,290 --> 00:12:15,040
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

277
00:12:15,300 --> 00:12:18,260
♪I'll only say that once♪

278
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:20,500
♪I called your name♪

279
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,330
♪The silent stars hang low♪

280
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:30,960
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

281
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:34,090
♪I linger in the old tower♪

282
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:37,870
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

283
00:12:39,180 --> 00:12:41,640
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

284
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:45,300
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

285
00:12:46,070 --> 00:12:48,310
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

286
00:12:48,310 --> 00:12:54,550
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

287
00:12:54,810 --> 00:12:57,690
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

288
00:12:58,290 --> 00:13:01,790
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

289
00:13:01,790 --> 00:13:04,430
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

290
00:13:04,430 --> 00:13:08,720
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

291
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:11,630
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

292
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:14,780
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

293
00:13:14,780 --> 00:13:17,450
♪If we meet again in another life♪

294
00:13:17,770 --> 00:13:20,500
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

295
00:13:21,190 --> 00:13:23,480
♪Was when we first met?♪

296
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:27,140
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

297
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:30,030
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
